WEBVTT

00:27:28.246 --> 00:27:34.371
Right. Just understanding that I can look
at my child and say, you know what?

00:27:35.913 --> 00:27:39.538
You're a wonderful kid. That
was a really stupid choice

00:27:40.038 --> 00:27:43.829
and how different that is from
your stupid kid. Yeah.

00:27:44.454 --> 00:27:46.788
Which changes who people are, you know.